=== postman/README.md ===
     1	# Postman collection
     2	
     3	`claims-workflow.postman_collection.json` contains the full local happy-path API sequence. It obtains CSRF/session cookies, extracts the generated claim ID and version, supplies per-operation idempotency keys, polls the payment outbox, and closes the claim without hand editing request bodies, tokens, or IDs. `scripts/run-postman.sh` creates an owner-only temporary environment from ignored `.env`, then runs the collection when Newman is installed.
     4	
     5	Newman 6.2.1 is pinned in the root `package.json`. Execution remains `NOT_RUN` until `npm ci` has provisioned it and the complete run is executed. The demo account password is sourced from `.env`; no credential is committed.

